{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RVUv1ve32Q1794996452.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>騰訊季度純利幾乎無增長。</p><p></p><p>賺636億元人民幣，按年升百分之0.7，按季升一成三。經調整純利665億元，按年跌半成。收入按年升百分之7，當中增值服務升百分之2，營銷服務升一成八。上季本土市場遊戲收入，按年升一成一。</p><p></p><p>集團表示以詞元消耗量計，旗下WorkBuddy已發展為內地最大規模AI應用，加上集團分配更多算力，雲服務收入增速進一步提升，核心業務也保持韌性。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T11:24:00.917797+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T10:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T00:57:17.221722+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T11:17:16.061147+00:00","content_hash":"ebb20ff8d15771df27adb6af21c2bdd4d98da28a82ee94b86f8b35483bbe56b2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T11:24:00.917797+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}